## Scope reconciliation (honest deviation from the GENERATED prompt paths)

The generated prompt targets `apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Admin/SchemaDriftPage.swift`
and `apps/parity/apple-ledger.json`. Neither path exists in this repo, and
`Features/Admin/` is NOT a compiled source root in `apps/apple/project.yml`. The
real, building convention (1438 surfaces, e.g. AiUsageCard / BrowserPushChannelCard)
is the globbed `apps/apple/TeslaSync/feature-views/` directory with a multi-file
surface pattern. Implementing under the idealized path would have produced a file
that never compiles. Decision: follow the REAL repo convention (feature-views/ +
the per-surface file split + per-surface `.strings` table). The string keys are the
EXACT web key names so a future merge into Localizable.xcstrings is a no-op rename.
Navigation is NOT wired into the shared AppRoute/RouteHostRegistry — 0 of 1438
surfaces do (that is the P4 shell/nav dependency layer); the surface is route-ready
and exposes `.navigationTitle` (the native peer of web `usePageTitle`).

