## Web-fidelity notes (ported verbatim — arithmetic NOT "fixed")
 - fmtNumber(v, decimals) → SchemaDriftFormat.number: locale grouping, fixed fraction
   digits, half-up, safeNumber(non-finite⇒0). Display precision carried as
   decimalPrecision (web global `settings.decimal_precision ?? 2`).
 - formatDelta → SchemaDriftFormat.delta: 0 ⇒ "0" (no fraction digits); >0 ⇒ "+"+fmt;
   <0 ⇒ fmt (keeps its own minus).
 - formatDateTime → SchemaDriftFormat.dateTime: medium date + short time; unparseable ⇒ "—".
 - `{sha256 || '—'}` and `{generatedAt && …}` (absent OR empty ⇒ no Captured line) preserved.
 - is_different drives the status badge (web `is_different ?? has_drift`).
 - P4 leaf additions over the web: loading skeleton (web shows a blank body) and a
   retryable error (web folds a non-503 failure into the empty state). Declared as the
   required `loading` / `error` data states; every branch renders a surface (ADR-011).

## A11y / HIG / units
 - Dynamic-type tokens (Font.TS), dark/light/increased-contrast dynamic colors (Color.TS),
   VoiceOver labels + .isHeader traits, ContentUnavailableView for empty, ≥44pt Retry.
 - No SI unit values on this page (counts + sha + timestamp only); date formatted at the
   display boundary with an injected locale + time zone.

